.TH MKV-AUDIO-EXTRACTOR 1 "October 2026" "1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mkv-audio-extractor \- extract audio tracks from MKV files with language selection
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mkv-audio-extractor
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE_OR_DIR\fR...
.br
.B mkv-audio-extractor
[\fIwithout options launches GUI\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mkv-audio-extractor
is a utility to extract audio tracks from Matroska (.mkv) video files.
It supports both a PyQt6 graphical interface and a command-line interface.
It allows filtering tracks by ISO 639 language codes, copying streams without re-encoding,
or converting them to MP3, AAC, FLAC, Opus, or WAV.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-list
List audio tracks in the specified file(s) and exit without extracting.
.TP
.BR \-\-all
Extract all audio tracks found in the input files.
.TP
.BI \-\-lang " CODES"
Comma-separated ISO 639 language codes to extract (e.g., hin,tam,tel,jpn,eng).
.TP
.BI \-\-track " INDICES"
Comma-separated track stream indices to extract (0-based, e.g., 0,2,4).
.TP
.BI \-\-mode " {copy,convert}"
Extraction mode: \fBcopy\fR (default, lossless extraction preserving stream codec)
or \fBconvert\fR (re-encode to specified format).
.TP
.BI \-\-convert\-to " {mp3,aac,flac,opus,wav}"
Target audio format when using \fB\-\-mode convert\fR.
.TP
.BI \-\-bitrate " BITRATE"
Audio bitrate for conversion (e.g., 192k, 320k).
.TP
.BI \-o ", " \-\-output " DIR"
Destination directory for extracted audio files. Default is a subfolder named after the source video file.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-recursive
Recursively scan directories for MKV files.
.TP
.BI \-\-overwrite " {rename,overwrite,skip}"
Action to take when an output file already exists. Default is \fBrename\fR.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Enable verbose logging output.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B Extract Hindi, Tamil, and Japanese audio tracks in copy mode:
mkv-audio-extractor "movie.mkv" \-\-lang hin,tam,jpn \-\-mode copy
.TP
.B Extract all audio tracks to a specific folder:
mkv-audio-extractor "movie.mkv" \-\-all \-o ~/Music/extracted
.TP
.B Convert English audio to 320k MP3:
mkv-audio-extractor "movie.mkv" \-\-lang eng \-\-mode convert \-\-convert-to mp3 \-\-bitrate 320k
.TP
.B List tracks without extracting:
mkv-audio-extractor "movie.mkv" \-\-list
